{"id":"fcd465e3faf82dc1","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-m-complete.md","title":"Many-One Complete","display":"df-m-complete — Many-One Complete","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-m-complete","aliases":["90-df-m-complete"],"display":"df-m-complete — Many-One Complete","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-m-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-m-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-m-complete — Many-One Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m\">\\(\\le_m\\)</span> 的关系定义直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a>；其中全可计算函数与本书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a> 的定义一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (sets)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably enumerable set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> (unary total recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}\">\\(\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\)</span> (many-one completeness predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\n\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\rightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(n\\in B\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\n\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\rightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(n\\in B\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 c.e. 集类中的多一完全集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> : 递归可枚举集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> : 多一可归约</li>\n<li>Creative集都是m-完全的</li>\n<li>具体停机集合的完备性须指定编号并给出归约；本定义不预先把未绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 作为已定义常量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a> — Creative集</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"77de281b9ec93c50\" href=\"?note=77de281b9ec93c50\" title=\"90-prop-creative-complete\">90-prop-creative-complete</a> — Creative集是完全的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"87fbc479272c5469","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"87fbc479272c5469","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\le_m$ 的关系定义直接取 [[88-df-many-one-reducible]]